# Agent Kate Midnight — terminal color scheme matching the signature dark theme.
# Navy canvas, cool-white text, neon-pink/purple accents. Installed into the
# user's Konsole data dir by AgentKate; regenerated from the app, so edit the
# theme in-app rather than here.

